      "statement": "In cert-manager 1.17.0, the CA and SelfSigned issuers sign with SHA-512 when the RSA key is 4096 bits or larger, and with SHA-384 when it is 3072 bits or larger, so systems that rely on these certificates must support those hash algorithms."
